14:23:48  Chat Computer can't open macOS's own files: on this Mac they're always encrypted, with keys only macOS can use
14:23:48  (FileVault or not). So setup copies the folders you choose onto a drive called ChatComp that both systems open;
14:23:48  macOS keeps its own copies. What you save on that drive in Chat Computer is in macOS too, and you can send more
14:23:48  later (run setup again).
